[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14041.269, "timestamp": "03:54:01", "text": "是的，我以为那会对我有帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14043.11, "timestamp": "03:54:03", "text": "就像你知道在《堡垒之夜》里你可以那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14045.189, "timestamp": "03:54:05", "text": "打开音频可视化工具，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14047.269, "timestamp": "03:54:07", "text": "帮助你了解物品的位置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14051.15, "timestamp": "03:54:11", "text": "或者说，除了痛苦之外，什么都做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14055.429, "timestamp": "03:54:15", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14060.28, "timestamp": "03:54:20", "text": "在我看来有点模糊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14062.71, "timestamp": "03:54:22", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14065.83, "timestamp": "03:54:25", "text": "哇。等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14068.309, "timestamp": "03:54:28", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14070.87, "timestamp": "03:54:30", "text": "那个端口密钥把我们带到了哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14072.63, "timestamp": "03:54:32", "text": "离伦敦比马车还远"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14074.389, "timestamp": "03:54:34", "text": "旅行过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14075.91, "timestamp": "03:54:35", "text": "我们现在在苏格兰的某个地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14078.87, "timestamp": "03:54:38", "text": "高地。先生，那些废墟。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14080.55, "timestamp": "03:54:40", "text": "我认为端口密钥是用来引导我们的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14083.83, "timestamp": "03:54:43", "text": "那里？我愿意。今天并非那一天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14087.03, "timestamp": "03:54:47", "text": "我们俩都预料到了。但米利暗派人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14090.15, "timestamp": "03:54:50", "text": "那把通往乔治的港口钥匙是有原因的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14093.59, "timestamp": "03:54:53", "text": "我相信她，还有现在的乔治"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14096.07, "timestamp": "03:54:56", "text": "死于追求某种目标的过程中，无论它意味着什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14099.189, "timestamp": "03:54:59", "text": "导致。如果你确定你们都……"}]